            <identifier label="SchW" xml:id="identifier_4017ab3e">B3:001</identifier>
            <title xml:id="title_ca59ba39" xml:lang="de">Der CXVII Psalm</title>
            <title type="alternative" xml:id="title_841aa883" xml:lang="de">Lobet den Herrn</title>
            <contributor xml:id="respStmt_01fd226a">
               <persName role="composer" xml:id="persName_2685f972">Johann Adolph Scheibe</persName>
            </contributor>
            <history xml:id="history_9b950cce">
               <eventList type="performances" xml:id="eventList_164d1be4">
                  <event xml:id="event_52054128">
                     <date isodate="1757" xml:id="date_724bfe62">1757</date>
                     <geogName role="place" xml:id="geogName_c33dff70">Neukirche, Leipzig</geogName>
                     <biblList xml:id="biblList_016ee8ca">
                        <head xml:id="head_f7dd808f">Reviews</head>
                     </biblList>
                     <biblList xml:id="biblList_6278e3f4">
                        <head xml:id="head_f4ba3095">Evidence</head>
                     </biblList>
                  </event>
               </eventList>
               <p xml:id="idm101">Though the work was performed as late as in 1757 (Neukirche, Leipzig) by <persName xml:id="idm102" auth.uri="http://www.viaf.org" auth="VIAF" role="">Carl Gotthelf Gerlach</persName>, it seems probable that it must date from before Scheibe left Leipzig in 1735. The work was acquired by Breitkopf in 1761 from the estate of Gerlach and remained there as one of their master copies. It appears to have been auctioned in 1836.</p>
            </history>
